        "filament": {
          "description": "NEW-v2 (H2, C2 \u00a74.5). The operating copy of this bay's filament that `openams_spoolman` pushes (material and working temperature); null when nothing was pushed, when it was cleared, or after a Klipper restart until the component pushes again. Memory only: it is never persisted, and Spoolman stays the store.",
          "oneOf": [
            {
              "type": "null"
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": ["material", "temp_c", "source"],
